+# Wire Serialisation Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on a wire serialisation format. The project's recorded decisions cover other areas (compression algorithm, cache eviction policy, password hashing algorithm, TLS backend, async runtime, versioning strategy, project license, and certificate verification), but none of them designates a wire serialisation format, and a dedicated search of the repository confirmed there is no existing policy or decision-record documentation on this topic.
